<title>USA: Regulators approve Bank West stock buyback.</title>
<headline>Regulators approve Bank West stock buyback.</headline>
<dateline>GRAND RAPIDS, Mich. 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank West Financial Corp said Thursday the Office of Thrift Supervision approved its plan to repurchase up to 198,000 of its common shares.</p>
<p>Bank West originally announced the stock buyback program in October, saying the stock represents an attractive investment opportunity.</p>
<p>The shares represent 10 percent of the thrift holding company's common shares, Bank West said.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
